    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-σῑμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snub-nosed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				940
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
